                {
                    "text": "Thank you dear Zafyro for all of your amazingly creative videos. \ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\udc99 I have been listening to your \" PLEIADIAN HEALING MANTRAS-MEDITATION, SLEEP & DEEP RELAXATION\" video daily since finding it about a month ago. It truly helps my challenged nervous system. You have such a gorgeous voice and are very creative. I so look forward to reuniting with my Pleiadian family in the near future. Sending love and light to you and everyone. \ud83d\ude07\ud83d\udc99\ud83c\udf08\ud83c\udf20",
                    "author": "@Dancerlil",
                    "likes": 2,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-20T17:55:44Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\u0414\u044f\u043a\u0443\u044e.\u0434\u0443\u0436\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u0442\u0443\u0436\u043d\u043e \u0456 \u0433\u0430\u0440\u043d\u043e \ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83e\udef6\ud83e\udef6\ud83e\udef6\ud83e\udef6",
